#: linux/share/monet/games/GamePage.qml:24 linux/share/monet/games/Games.qml:1426
msgid ""
"Players report it doesn't run in Monet, so it plays in Windows. In Steam, move it to Windows games (Properties, Installed Files, Move install folder), and Play starts it there, with nothing to download."
msgstr ""
"Spillere melder, at det ikke kører i Monet, så det spilles i Windows. Flyt det i Steam til \"Windows games\" (Egenskaber, Installerede filer, Flyt installationsmappe), så starter Spil det dér, uden noget at downloade."

#: linux/share/monet/games/GamePage.qml:26 linux/share/monet/games/Games.qml:1428
msgid ""
"Its anti-cheat only lets it play in Windows. In Steam, move it to Windows games (Properties, Installed Files, Move install folder), and Play starts it there, with nothing to download."
msgstr ""
"Dets anti-snyd lader det kun køre i Windows. Flyt det i Steam til \"Windows games\" (Egenskaber, Installerede filer, Flyt installationsmappe), så starter Spil det dér, uden noget at downloade."

#: linux/share/monet/games/GamePage.qml:28 linux/share/monet/games/Games.qml:1430
msgid ""
"Players report it doesn't run in Monet, and it isn't installed in Windows yet. Restart in Windows and install it with %1."
msgstr ""
"Spillere melder, at det ikke kører i Monet, og det er ikke installeret i Windows endnu. Genstart i Windows, og installer det med %1."

#: linux/share/monet/games/GamePage.qml:30 linux/share/monet/games/Games.qml:1432
msgid ""
"Its anti-cheat only lets it play in Windows, and it isn't installed there yet. Restart in Windows and install it with %1."
msgstr ""
"Dets anti-snyd lader det kun køre i Windows, og det er ikke installeret der endnu. Genstart i Windows, og installer det med %1."

#: linux/share/monet/games/GamePage.qml:31
msgid ""
"Installed once, in Windows' Games folder: it plays here and in Windows."
msgstr ""
"Installeret én gang, i Windows' Games-mappe: det spilles her og i Windows."

#: linux/share/monet/games/GamePage.qml:33
msgid ""
