msgstr "Det kunne ikke installeres. Tjek internetforbindelsen, og prøv igen."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7467
msgid ""
"Windows key + Alt + G keeps the last 30 seconds on screen in Videos. The first time, choose the screen to record."
msgstr ""
"Windows-tasten + Alt + G gemmer de sidste 30 sekunder på skærmen i Videoer. Første gang skal du vælge den skærm, der skal optages."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7480 linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7623 linux/libexec/monet-quick:5498
msgid "Shared with Windows"
msgstr "Delt med Windows"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7492 linux/libexec/monet-quick:4054
msgid "Windows games"
msgstr "Windows-spil"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7493
msgid "Install each game once"
msgstr "Installer hvert spil én gang"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7494
msgid ""
"Windows didn't shut down fully, so its drive isn't open to Monet this time. It is again after your next trip to Windows."
msgstr ""
"Windows blev ikke lukket helt ned, så dets drev er ikke åbent for Monet denne gang. Det er det igen efter din næste tur i Windows."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7495
msgid ""
"Windows wants to check its drive first. It does that by itself the next time it starts."
msgstr ""
"Windows vil først tjekke sit drev. Det gør det af sig selv, næste gang det starter."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7497
msgid ""
"Windows' drive is encrypted with BitLocker. Start Windows once, and Monet Bridge hands its recovery key over: Monet opens it by itself from then on. Or type the key here."
msgstr ""
"Windows' drev er krypteret med BitLocker. Start Windows én gang, så giver Monet Bridge gendannelsesnøglen videre: Monet åbner det selv fra da af. Eller skriv nøglen her."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7498
msgid ""
"Windows' drive is encrypted with BitLocker. Type its recovery key once, and Monet opens it at every start, for games, files and Wi-Fi in both."
msgstr ""
"Windows' drev er krypteret med BitLocker. Skriv dets genoprettelsesnøgle én gang, så åbner Monet det ved hver start, til spil, filer og Wi-Fi i begge."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7499
msgid ""
"Windows' drive is open. Monet Bridge installs itself the next time Windows starts, and from then on games, files and Wi-Fi work in both."
msgstr ""
"Windows' drev er åbent. Monet Bridge installerer sig selv, næste gang Windows starter, og derefter virker spil, filer og Wi-Fi i begge."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7500
msgid "Windows' drive couldn't be opened this time."
msgstr "Windows' drev kunne ikke åbnes denne gang."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7501
msgid ""
"Steam here and Steam in Windows both play from it. When you install a game, choose Windows games, and it's ready on both."
msgstr ""
"Steam her og Steam i Windows spiller begge derfra. Vælg \"Windows games\", når du installerer et spil, så er det klar begge steder."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7502
msgid ""
"Steam here can keep games in Windows' Games folder, where Windows plays them too. Steam closes for a moment to add it."
msgstr ""
"Steam her kan lægge spil i Windows' Games-mappe, hvor Windows også spiller dem. Steam lukker et øjeblik for at tilføje den."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7503
msgid ""
"Steam keeps games for both in Windows' Games folder for the person who set up this PC."
msgstr ""
"Steam lægger spil til begge i Windows' Games-mappe for den person, der satte denne pc op."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7539
msgid "Recovery key, 48 digits"
msgstr "Genoprettelsesnøgle, 48 cifre"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7545
msgid "Unlocking…"
msgstr "Låser op…"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7545
msgid "Unlock"
msgstr "Lås op"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7553
msgid ""
"It's in your Microsoft account, or in Windows: search for Manage BitLocker, then Back up your recovery key."
msgstr ""
"Den ligger på din Microsoft-konto, eller i Windows: søg efter Administrer BitLocker, og vælg Sikkerhedskopiér din genoprettelsesnøgle."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7560
msgid "Find my key"
msgstr "Find min nøgle"

