"Get Heroic for your Epic and GOG games. One you install in Windows games plays in Windows too."
msgstr ""
"Hent Heroic til dine Epic- og GOG-spil. Et spil, du installerer i \"Windows games\", kører også i Windows."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7579
