msgstr ""
"En mappe, Windows også har, som \"Shared with Monet\": gem en download, et mod eller et installationsprogram dér én gang, så er det i begge. Filer viser den blandt dine steder."

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7634
msgid "Where your games are"
msgstr "Hvor dine spil ligger"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7660
msgid "Steam, Heroic and Lutris keep theirs here once you install one"
msgstr ""
"Steam, Heroic og Lutris lægger deres her, når du har installeret en af dem"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7667
msgid "Needs Windows"
msgstr "Kræver Windows"

#: linux/share/monet/settings-app/MonetSettings.qml:7681
msgid ""
"Its anti-cheat only allows Windows. It's in Windows games, ready there."
msgstr ""
"Dets anti-snyd tillader kun Windows. Det ligger i \"Windows games\", klar dér."

