"Its anti-cheat only allows Windows. In Steam, move it to Windows games (Properties, Installed Files, Move install folder), and it's ready there."
msgstr ""
"Dets anti-snyd tillader kun Windows. Flyt det i Steam til \"Windows games\" (Egenskaber, Installerede filer, Flyt installationsmappe), så er det klar dér."

