#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:253 crates/monet/src/main.rs:344
msgid ""
"Windows isn't installed yet. Choose Windows in the app menu to finish setting it up."
msgstr ""
"Windows er ikke installeret endnu. Vælg Windows i appmenuen for at gøre opsætningen færdig."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:255
msgid ""
"Windows is encrypted with BitLocker. Type its recovery key in Settings › Games & Controllers, and Monet opens it and sets it up."
msgstr ""
"Windows er krypteret med BitLocker. Skriv dets genoprettelsesnøgle i Indstillinger › Spil & controllere, så åbner Monet det og gør det klar."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:260
msgid ""
"Windows is asleep, so Monet can't set it up yet. Open Windows, choose Restart, and Monet finishes the rest."
msgstr ""
"Windows er i dvale, så Monet kan ikke sætte det op endnu. Åbn Windows, vælg Genstart, og Monet klarer resten."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:268
msgid "This PC didn't start in UEFI mode, so Monet can't switch to Windows."
msgstr ""
"Denne pc startede ikke i UEFI-tilstand, så Monet kan ikke skifte til Windows."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:275 crates/monet/src/main.rs:602
msgid ""
"Windows wasn't found on this PC. Install Windows first, then try again."
msgstr ""
"Windows blev ikke fundet på denne pc. Installer Windows først, og prøv så igen."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:295
msgid "Not found"
msgstr "Ikke fundet"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:297
msgid "Unavailable (not a UEFI system)"
msgstr "Ikke tilgængelig (ikke et UEFI-system)"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:357
msgid "Play %1 on Windows?"
msgstr "Spil %1 i Windows?"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:358
msgid "Open in Windows?"
msgstr "Åbn i Windows?"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:359
msgid "Play on Windows?"
msgstr "Spil i Windows?"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:366
msgid "Your PC will restart in Windows and open it. Open apps will close."
msgstr "Din pc genstarter i Windows og åbner den. Åbne apps lukkes."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:367
msgid ""
"Your PC will restart in Windows and open FACEIT, then the game. When you quit, it comes back to Monet."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:368
msgid ""
"Your PC will restart in Windows and start the game. When you quit, it comes back to Monet."
msgstr ""
"Din pc genstarter i Windows og starter spillet. Når du afslutter, vender den tilbage til Monet."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:369
msgid ""
"Your PC will restart in Windows with your game launchers ready to sign in to. Open apps will close."
msgstr ""
"Din pc genstarter i Windows med dine spilklienter klar til, at du logger ind. Åbne apps lukkes."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:370
msgid ""
"Your PC will restart in Windows, where FACEIT's own installers open for you. Accept their terms only if you agree, then sign in. Open apps will close."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:371
msgid ""
"Your PC will restart in Windows, update it and your games, and switch off when they're done. Open apps will close."
msgstr ""
"Din pc genstarter i Windows, opdaterer det og dine spil og slukker, når alt er færdigt. Åbne apps lukkes."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:372
msgid "Your PC will restart in Windows. Open apps will close."
msgstr "Din pc genstarter i Windows. Åbne apps bliver lukket."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:374
msgid ""
"Save your work first. Unsaved changes and private tabs aren't captured. Downloads stop during the restart; check Store's Downloads when you return."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:606
msgid ""
"Monet seems to have started from the Windows entry, which shouldn't happen."
msgstr ""
"Monet ser ud til at være startet fra Windows' opstartspost, hvilket ikke burde ske."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:645
msgid ""
"This PC's firmware didn't keep the switch to Windows. Restart and choose Windows in the PC's boot menu."
msgstr ""
"Denne pc's firmware huskede ikke skiftet til Windows. Genstart, og vælg Windows i pc'ens opstartsmenu."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:676
msgid ""
"The restart was blocked. The switch to Windows was cancelled. Save your work and try again."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:694
msgid ""
"Monet couldn't identify your desktop account. Start Windows from your desktop and try again."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:700
msgid "Your desktop account could not be found. The switch was cancelled."
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:824
msgid "This copy of Monet can't install Windows by itself."
msgstr "Denne kopi af Monet kan ikke selv installere Windows."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:883
msgid ""
"Monet can install Windows from %1. Your PC restarts and Windows installs itself."
msgstr ""
"Monet kan installere Windows fra %1. Din pc genstarter, og Windows installerer sig selv."

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:886
msgid ""
"Windows isn't installed yet. Monet downloads it from Microsoft (about 7 GB) and installs it. This takes about 30 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Windows er ikke installeret endnu. Monet downloader det fra Microsoft (ca. 7 GB) og installerer det. Det tager ca. 30 minutter."

