msgid "Set up Windows?"
msgstr "Vil du sætte Windows op?"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:890
msgid "Set Up"
msgstr "Sæt op"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:894
msgid "Getting Windows ready for your games"
msgstr "Gør Windows klar til dine spil"

