msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:948
msgid "Open Settings"
msgstr ""

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:957
msgid "there isn't enough free space for Windows"
msgstr "der er ikke nok ledig plads til Windows"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:958
msgid ""
"Windows needs about 72 GB of the disk to itself, and 16 GB free in Monet while it downloads."
msgstr ""
"Windows skal bruge ca. 72 GB af disken for sig selv og 16 GB ledig plads i Monet, mens det downloades."

