msgid ""
"Windows couldn't be set up this time. Choose Windows in the app menu to try again."
msgstr ""
"Windows kunne ikke sættes op denne gang. Vælg Windows i appmenuen for at prøve igen."

#: crates/monet/src/trip.rs:416
msgid ""
"Windows didn't start: this PC skipped Monet's one-time start. Next time, Monet asks it a different way."
msgstr ""
"Windows startede ikke: denne pc sprang Monets engangsstart over. Næste gang spørger Monet på en anden måde."

